<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-LucasVarity raised at Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-LucasVarity raised at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auto components group LucasVarity Plc was raised to &quot;market outperformer&quot; from &quot;market performer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
